# Base URL of the control plane API (origin only, no trailing slash, no /api suffix).
# Set this when the UI is hosted on a different origin (e.g. Vercel). It is inlined at build time.
# Leave it empty (or unset) for local dev: the Vite dev server proxies /api to the control plane,
# and when the control plane serves the built UI itself the calls are same-origin.
VITE_API_URL=https://control.example.com
